'''Machines in Revolt''' (機械の反乱軍, ''Kikai no Hanrangun'', '''Rebel Army of Machines''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]]. It is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. Each stage features [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]] and has a [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]] as a reward.

==Event Information==
Clear stages in the special map {{Color|#9900FF|'''Machines in Revolt'''}} to earn up to {{Color|#FF6D01|'''10 Cat Tickets'''}} as you face off against the Metal enemies attacking the remnants of a destroyed city! Visit Event Stages/Stories of Legend and select to take on this challenge!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between July 6th (11:00am) and July 13th (10:59am)!'''}}

Save the future from the onslaught of the coming machines!

※ After clearing a stage, there will be a short cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A will allow you to skip the stage cooldown period and challenge the next stage immediately.<br>
※ If the event does not appear, please make sure that you are updated to the latest version of the Battle Cats app.

